<section id="computer-use" class="work"><div class="section-shell work-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">A companion that can lend a hand</p><h2 class="section-title">Less busywork.<br />More breathing room.</h2><p class="section-copy">Ask Nolune to find a file, research an idea, or work in your apps. It can see and act on the computers you connect, with one conversation to keep everything together.</p><a class="text-link" href="#how">See how it works <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><div class="conversation" aria-label="Illustrative Nolune conversation"><div class="chat-top"><img src="/assets/nolune-moon.svg" alt="" width="32" height="32" /><strong>nolune</strong><span>Example conversation</span></div><div class="chat-body"><p class="user-message">Find the notes from yesterday and turn them into a short project brief.</p><div class="reply"><img src="/assets/nolune-moon.svg" alt="" width="30" height="30" /><div><p>I found your notes. Here’s a brief with the key decisions and next steps.</p><div class="file"><svg class="file-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 3H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V9Z" /><path d="M14 3v6h6M8 13h8M8 17h6" /></svg><div><strong>Project brief</strong><small>Ready for you to review</small></div><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div></div></div><p class="chat-caption">Your context, put to work.</p></div></div></div></section>
